# Agent Wallet Bench

Coding agents set up crypto wallets on their own. Each cell is one agent with one wallet; its link opens every run.

<%= line(@matrix.notes["setup"]) %>

<%= line(@matrix.notes["runs"]) %>

<%= line(@matrix.notes["grid_started"]) %>

## What each result means

<%= for outcome <- outcomes() do %>- `<%= outcome %>`: <%= line(@matrix.notes[outcome]) %>
<% end %>
